{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"role":"article","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, build "},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide is the shortest path from a wired Swidux app with "},{"code":"SwiduxAnalytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" registered to events landing in Mixpanel. It assumes you have already followed Swidux’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" guide through Step 5 — that is, your "},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has an "},{"code":"analytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" slice, your "},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" routes "},{"code":".analytics(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and you have an "},{"code":"AnalyticsMapper","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" declared."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Add-the-package","text":"Add the package","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" File > Add Package Dependencies, paste "},{"code":"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Add the "},{"code":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" product to your target."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Package.swift:"}]}]},{"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\", from: \"1.0.0\"),"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"code":[".product(name: \"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\", package: \"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\"),"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Build-the-service-at-launch","text":"Build the service at launch","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" owns "},{"code":"Mixpanel.initialize","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" internally — you do not need to "},{"code":"import Mixpanel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Construct the service with your token (and any Mixpanel knobs you care about) before configuring the store:"}]},{"code":["import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","import SwiftUI","","@main","struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var store: AppStore","","    init() {","        let analyticsService = MixpanelAnalyticsService(","            token: \"your-mixpanel-token\",","            optOutTrackingByDefault: true","        )","        _store = State(wrappedValue: AppStore.configured(analyticsService: analyticsService))","    }","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup { ContentView().environment(store) }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The initializer surfaces every Mixpanel knob the app would otherwise need to set on "},{"code":"Mixpanel.initialize","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (EU "},{"code":"serverURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"optOutTrackingByDefault","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"flushInterval","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"instanceName","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"superProperties","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"useGzipCompression","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"trackAutomaticEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"excludeProperties","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and is identical on every platform. Pick what you need; everything else has a sensible default. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for the longer treatment."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Register-the-plugin-with-MixpanelAnalyticsService","text":"Register the plugin with `MixpanelAnalyticsService`","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the service to "},{"code":"AnalyticsPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in your "},{"code":"Store.configured()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" factory:"}]},{"code":["import Swidux","import SwiduxAnalytics","import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","","extension Store where State == AppState, Action == AppAction {","    static func configured(analyticsService: some AnalyticsService) -> AppStore {","        let plugins = PluginHost<AppState, AppAction>()","","        plugins.register(","            AnalyticsPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","                state: \\.analytics,","                action: AppAction.analytics,","                extractAction: { if case .analytics(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","                service: analyticsService,","                mapper: analyticsMapper,","                identity: analyticsIdentity","            )","        )","","        return Store(","            initialState: AppState(),","            reducer: AppReducer().reduce,","            plugins: plugins","        )","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That’s it — the plugin will route mapped events through the service, re-fire "},{"code":"identify","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" whenever the "},{"code":"(userID, userProperties)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" pair derived from state changes, and flush on your call to "},{"code":"store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"code":"scenePhase == .background","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Verify-the-wiring","text":"Verify the wiring","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dispatch a screen view from your root view’s "},{"code":".onAppear","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and confirm the event arrives in Mixpanel’s Live View:"}]},{"code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        RootContent()","            .onAppear { store.send(.analytics(.screenView(\"Home\"))) }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Next-Steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService"},{"type":"text","text":" — EU residency, opt-out by default, multiple Mixpanel projects, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelInstance"},{"type":"text","text":" escape hatch."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest"},{"type":"text","text":" — Drive analytics state from previews and tests using "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ValueTranslation"},{"type":"text","text":" — How "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsValue"},{"type":"text","text":" cases map onto Mixpanel "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Properties"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"]]},"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/HowToPreviewAndTest":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive "},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites without touching Mixpanel’s network."}],"title":"How to Preview and Test","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtopreviewandtest","role":"article"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/HowToImplementService":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Configure ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to match your privacy, residency, and batching needs — without ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Mixpanel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in your app.","type":"text"}],"title":"How to Implement the Service","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtoimplementservice","role":"article"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics":{"type":